Port 2222
Protocol 2

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes

AllowUsers window testuser
AllowGroups sudo testuser

# ---- Timing & Attempts (IMPORTANT CHANGES) ----
LoginGraceTime 60        # was 20 → now 60 seconds
MaxAuthTries 5           # was 3 → allow more attempts for detection
MaxSessions 3            # slightly higher for realism

# ---- Connection Lifetime ----
ClientAliveInterval 120  # keep session alive
ClientAliveCountMax 3    # total ~6 minutes idle allowed

UseDNS no
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no

SyslogFacility AUTH
LogLevel VERBOSE
